Setup			p3disoj

### Disk parameters

AspectRatio     	0.05            Thickness over Radius in the disc
Sigma0			6.0e-4		Surface Density at r=1
Nu			1.0e-5		Uniform kinematic viscosity
SigmaSlope		0.5		Slope of surface
FlaringIndex		0.0

### Planet parameters

PlanetConfig		planets/jupiter.cfg
ThicknessSmoothing 	0.1		Smoothing parameters in disk thickness

### Numerical method parameters

Disk			YES
OmegaFrame     		1.0
Frame			C
IndirectTerm		No

### Mesh parameters

Nx			128		Azimuthal number of zones 
Ny               	64		Radial number of zones
Nz			32		Number of zones in colatitude
Ymin			0.5		Inner boundary radius
Ymax			1.5		Outer boundary radius
Zmin			1.42079632679489661922
Zmax			1.57079632679489661922
Xmin			-3.141592653589793
Xmax			3.141592653589793

### Output control parameters

Ntot			200		Total number of time steps
Ninterm	 		20		Time steps between outputs
DT			0.314159265359	Time step length. 2PI = 1 orbit
OutputDir		@outputs/p3disoj


Field 			gasdens
PlotLine		field[:,:,0]
